# LeakSanitizer suppressions for leaks inside third-party libraries, which LCAD cannot fix.
# Keep this list short and specific: a suppression here hides every leak whose stack passes
# through the named library.

# When no D-Bus session bus answers (as in CI containers), Qt's D-Bus thread leaves a read
# buffer behind in libdbus.
leak:libdbus-1.so

# Same situation, when Qt loads the GTK platform theme: the accessibility bridge leaks its
# connection setup.
leak:libatk-bridge-2.0.so

# OCCT's STEP and IGES translators register their settings, editors, and a default placement in
# global tables the first time they are used, and never free them.
leak:STEPControl_Controller::Init
leak:IGESControl_Controller::Init
leak:XSAlgo::Init
leak:STEPConstruct_ContextTool::GetDefaultAxis
